<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETELO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wunzole wu Petelo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wunzole wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wunzole wusonika ntumwa Petelo. Bulendi ba ti ku minkwikidi mi mbanza yimosi ka sonika wo. Ka muntu ko wuta ti mukanda bewuwu wusonika wo ku yobobo ba kateka sonikina ntete. Mu dyambu ti, mpasi mu zaba kaa mikanda mya myole bemyomyo kwandi kasonika. Wuta kaka ti mukanda bewuwu ni wunzole wukabasonikina (tala 2 Pet 3.1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Petelo wuna zonzila bantu bayenda longa ku minkwikidi misamu miswaswana na Musamu Wumbote wu kabalonga. Bakwe hidikanga misamu mi batiidi mu hidika na bakwe tanga ti Yesu kavutuka dyaka ko. Petelo wuta dyaka ti luzingu lu munkwikidi lufweti yangidikanga Nzambi. Misamu myamyomyo mi kedika mi longa Yesu ku yobobo baba nandi kintwadi bu wakidi mu nza, mpe misamu myamyomyo mi bafweti tuula mu mitu myawu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Luzingu lu munkwikidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-11">1.3-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Kuba wukangama mu zindongosolo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:12-21">1.12-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Milongisi mi luvunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2.1-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Mvutukulu yi Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3.1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Meno Simoni Petelo, nii kisadi na ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Nsonikini ku yobobo batambudi kiminu kintalu bonso yeto, mu nzila yi kisalu ki mpulusu ki Nzambi eto mpe Yesu-Klisto Muvuukisi eto.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Bika Nzambi kaluhaana lusakumunu na kiyenge mu kitezo kihyokidi, mu nzila yi luzaabu lu kedika lu Nzambi na lu Yesu, Mfumu eto.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbokolo na nsoololo kuu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nzambi mu lulendo lwandi wutuhaana bima bimvimba bina tuhaana hwahwa mu zinga mu kintwadi na Nzambi. Wutuzabikisa yondowo wututumisa mu nkembo andi na bunene bu bumbote bwandi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Mu nkembo na lulendo belolo, Nzambi wutusila nsilulu zivudidi bunene na mfunu, mwanki tulenda mu tina nsadulu zimbi zikwe tukisanga nsatu zimbi zi nza beyiyi, mpe luzingu lwandi luyenika mu yeto. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Mu dyambu bedyodyo, seeno nkatika ngolo mu bwesa mu kiminu kyeno ndyatulu yimbote, mu ndyatulu yimbote bweseeno nzayilu yikedika yi Nzambi, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />mu nzayilu bweseeno kukiyaala, mu kukiyaala bweseeno lutatumunu, mpe mu lutatumunu bweseeno kuba kintwadi na Nzambi, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />mu kuba kintwadi na Nzambi bweseeno zola ku kimpangi, mpe mu zola ku kimpangi bweseeno luzolo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Tala ti nkadulu bezozo zii neeno, mpe zikudidi mu yeno, lwatatamana mu sala, mpe zina sa ti lutoma zaba Mfumu eto, Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Kansi ku yondowo lembolo ba na nkadulu bezozo, kalendi yena kukula ko, weka mpofo. Zimbakani ti wuvedoso mu masumu mandi ma ntama.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi, seeno ngolo mu ba bakangama nakekete mu mbokolo yi lutumisina Nzambi na nsoodolo yi kasa mu yeno, tala ti lusidi bobo, lwaabwa mu masumu ko. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ni bwabobo lwaabakila luve mu kota mu Kimfumu ki mimvu ka mimvu ki Mfumu eto mpe Muvuukisi, Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ni hahoho, ntangu zimvimba nina lubambulanga moyo mu misamu bemyomyo, mpeleko myaluzebi mpe ludi bakangama nakekete mu kikedika bekiki ki lutambudi. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Kansi nayeni ti bumbote budi mu lubambula moyo bu nakidi mu nitu beyiyi, mwanki luba bantu bana kaya meso. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Nzebi ti mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi mu sisa nitu beyiyi, bonso bundonkidi wo Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Kansi, mbo nasa ti ku manima ma nkwendolo ani, lubambukilanga misamu bemimi moyo ntangu zimvimba.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbangi zimona meso zi Yesu-Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ka mu dyambu di misamu mitoma kubika bantu mu bimpa byawu ko tuluteela nyizulu yi lulendo yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, kansi butudi mbangi zimona meso zi bunene bwandi. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Wutambula ku Tata Nzambi nkembo na nzitusu, mu ntangu ndinga yiyinene yita mu kati di nkembo andi ti: «Yandi ewu ni Mwana ani wu ntomini tya. Kyese kyani kimvimba mu yandi kidi.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Bu tuba nandi ha yulu mulandu wulongo, yeto bende tuyuwa ndinga beyoyo bu yiyuwakana ku mazulu.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Mpe tuna toma kwikila misamu mita mimbikudi. Lufweti yuwa bumbote misamu myandi: yandi wuu bonso mwinda wuna lezima ha kibuka kii mpimpa, natee bwisi bu bwatoona mu kya, mpe natee lubwetete lu mene bu lwalezima mu mitima myeno. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Tekila mimvimba, tomeeno zaba ti: kunaani muntu lendi bangula mu madyela ma yandi bende mbikudulu zi Masonama. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Mu dyambu ti kunaani mbikudulu yifumini mu luzolo lu muntu yandi bende. Kansi mu lusadusu lu Mpeve Yilongo, bantu babikula misamu mifuma ku Nzambi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Milongisi mi luvunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JUD 1:4-13">Yud4-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Muntama, kuba mpe na mimbikudi mi luvunu ha kati di mukangu wu Isaeli, bumosi mpe ha kati dyeno, kwaaba na milongisi mi luvunu. Baakotisa mu mansweki ndongosolo ziluvunu zaanata ku nzimbukusu eno, mpe baabisa Mfumu yi bakuula, zaabanata ha nsi na nsi ku nzimbukusu awu. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Bantu babingi baabalanda mu ndyatulu awu yi busafu mpe mu dyambu dyawu, bantu baavweza nzila yi kikedika. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mu dyambu di nzodi yi mbongo, baaluhuuna mu nzonzolo zi luvunu. Kansi, tuuka ntama mfundusu awu yikubama yidi, mpe nzimbukusu awu yaazingila ko.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Nzambi katabila zimbazi zi hola masumu, kansi wubabindika misinga mi bisengo na wubatuba ku mbungulu ku nsye tombe kingolo ku bakwe bakebanga natee mu kilumbu ki mfundusu. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Mpe katabila nza yintama ko, kansi bu katambika nyamba yiyinene ha nza yiba yifuluka mu minsumuki, Nowa kwandi kavuukisa wedi samunanga lunungu, ha kimosi na nsambwadi yihiika. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Mboki mpe, Nzambi wubonga nzengolo ye bunga mbanza zi Sodomo na Ngomola mu tiya, na zikituka bombe na bombe. Wulonka mu kifwani bekyokyo, misamu myaatudila minsumuki. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Kansi wuvuukisa Loti, muntu wulunungu, wedi yenanga kyadi kikingi mu dyambu di ndyatulu yi busafu yi bantu bebobo bakindumba. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />- Muntu bewuwu wulunungu wedi zinganga ha kati dyawu, wedi kwamusungu kadi kilumbu mu mutima andi mu dyambu di mavanga mawu mambi ma kedi yenanga na ma kedi yuwanga - <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Buna, Mfumu zebi mukuula bantu balunungu mu ntontolo, mpe zebi mukeba balembolo ba balunungu mwanki kasemba mu kilumbu ki mfundusu, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />mbo kasemba sungula yobobo bakwe landanga nsatu zi kimuntu zi mbi mpe bakwe safulanga kimfumu ki Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Milongisi mi luvunu bemyomyo baa na kivuvu mu yawu bende na mayama, mii na kivumi ko mu tuka zimpeve zinkembo zii ku mazulu.<verse eid="2PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Kati zimbazi zibavudidi mu ngolo na mu lulendo, zikwe tukanga zimpeve bezozo zinkembo ko mu bafunda ha ntadisi yi Mfumu. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kansi milongisi mi luvunu bemimi mii bonso bibulu bilembolo ba na madyela, mikubuku mu bakama mu mitambu na mu hondo. Yawu bakwe tyakanga byo bi balembolo zaba, mpe baafwa bonso bibulu, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />mpe baatambula mufutu wu mambi mawu, yawu bakwe yangalalanga mu mwini ngemba mu sadila kindumba. Bantu basafuka na basumuka badi. Bakwe yangalalanga mu luvunu lwawu bu bakwe dyanga kintwadi neeno mu ndambisa zeno. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Meso mawu mafuluka mu kinsuza, mpe mayukutanga masumu ko, bakwe bwilanga mu mutambu bantu balembolo ba basyama. Mitima myawu mii mifuluka mu mpwila ze tumbu baka. Mpe baala bansingulu badi. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bu basisa nzila yisungama, bazimbala bu balanda nzila yi Balami, mwana wu Bosoli, yondowo wutya mu bonka mbongo mu kwe sa mambi, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />kansi bamusemba bu kalembolo vumina Misiku: mbuluku yinkento yikwe lembolo zonzanga yitoona mu zonza mu ndinga yi yeto bantu, mpe yikakidila buzengi bu mumbikudi.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Milongisi mi luvunu bemyomyo mii bonso mikelo milembolo ba na mamba na matuti mana kwe natu ku kitembo. Babakubikila tombe kii na bokoboko [mimvu ka mimvu]. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Mu nzonzolo zawu zimpamba, bakwe bwilanga mu mutambu wu byese bi kinsuni na wu kindumba kyawu, yobobo bavukidi mu mutambu wu bantu bakwe zinganga mu nzimbukusu. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Bakwe basilanga nsilulu ye bahaana kimpwanza, nsyongono yawu bende mindongo kwandi midi mi nsatu zawu zimbi, mu dyambu ti kadi muntu wudi mundongo wu myo mikwe mu yaalanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Tala ti, yobobo bavukidi mu nsatu zimbi zinza, bu bazebi Mfumu eto na Muvuukisi eto, Yesu-Klisto, kansi babwesi bakama dyaka mu nsye luyaalu lwawu, buna kitezo kyawu kyaalutila bubi na bubabedi ha ntete. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Buba bumbote ku yawu mu lembolo zaba nzila yi lunungu, na mu zaaba yo, mboki batekidi manima mu mina milongo mi babahaana. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Misamu mi babwididi ni mina zonzila bingana ebi: «Mbwa yivutukidi mu dya bilusu bi kalukidi», mpe: «Ngulu yiyobidi malu-malu beyiyi, bwedi kwe vindumuka mu dyanga.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nsilulu yi nyizulu yi Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Mpangi zani zizola, ewu ni mukanda wunzole wu nalusonikini. Mu mikanda mya mimyole, ntiidi mu lubambula moyo mu sikimisa mu yeno, mayindu mambote, mu ndongosolo zi lutambula. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ntiidi lubambuka moyo mu misamu mi zonza mu ntama mimbikudi milongo na ntumunu zihaana Mfumu eto na Muvuukisi eto, mu nzila yi zintumwa zeno. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Tekila mimvimba, tomeeno zaba ti: mu bilumbu bimanunu, kwaakwiza bantu ba nga yola, baadyatila bonso budi nsatu zawu zimbi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Baata ti: «Wusa nsilulu yi nyizulu andi, kabwa ko e? Bwabu kwedi kadi e? Matata meto mamana fwa, kansi nakani kima kimosi kikitukidi ko tuka mbadukulu yinza!» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Batiidi mu zimbakana ti: tuka ntama, Nzambi wuhidika yulu na butoto mu mpova andi. Butoto buduuka ku nsye mamba na buyiza sikama ha kati-kati di mamba, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />bana zimbakana mpe ti, nyamba yiyinene yidyamisa na yizimbisa nza yintama. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Kansi mu mpova yi Nzambi, mazulu na butoto bi bubedidi, bii bilundama mu bungu ku tiya mu kilumbu ki mfundusu na nzimbukusu yi minsumuki.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Mpangi zani zizola, kuu na musamu wu lulendi zimbakana ko. Mu dyambu ti ha meso ma Mfumu, kilumbu kimosi kii bonso funda di mimvu (1000), mpe funda di mimvu (1000) dii bonso kilumbu kimosi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Mfumu kana zingila mu lungisa nsilulu andi ko, bonso buna banzila wo bahiika. Kansi kwe vibidilanga mu dyambu dyeno, mu dyambu ti katiidi ko nakani wumosi kahombila, mpe yandi tiidi ti bamvimba babaka ntangu ye vilula madyela.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Bwabu kilumbu ki Mfumu kyaakwiza bonso mwivi. Mu kilumbu bekyokyo, yulu dyaazimbala na lusuku lulunene, bima bi ku yulu byaahya na byaafuukusu, mpe butoto na bima byandi bimvimba, byaafuukusu mu tiya. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Budidi ti bima bimvimba bobo byaazimbidila, zaabeeno bwedi lufweti natina luzingu lweno. Bika ndyatulu eno yiba yilongo mpe luba bakangama mu Nzambi. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Lufweti kingila, mpe seeno ti kilumbu ki Mfumu kiiza mu muswalu. Mu kilumbu bekyokyo, yulu dyaahya, dyaanyengoso na bima bii ku yulu byaasulumuka mu mbangasi yi milaka mi tiya. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Kansi bonso Nzambi katusila nsilulu, tuna kingila, mazulu mamoona na butoto bumoona, koo kwaaba lunungu.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zani zizola, bu tuna kingila kilumbu bekyokyo, seeno ngolo mu ba bavedila, mpe mu lembolo ba na kibila ha meso ma Nzambi, mwanki lu ba mu kiyenge nandi. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Zabeeno ti luvibudulu lu Mfumu eto luna luhaana mpulusu. Pawuli, mpangi eto yizola, wutusonikina wo mu ndwenga zi muhaana Nzambi. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Myamyomyo mi kasonika mu mikanda mimvimba mu kana zonzila dyambu bedyodyo. Muu na misamu momo mii mpasi mu bakula, mpe bantu balembolo zaba na baa na mabanza yeku-yeku bana kituula myo mbangudulu, bonso bu bana sanga mu bibuku bihiika bi Masonama. Mu nsadulu beyoyo bana kota mu nzimbukusu awu.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Yeno zimpangi zani zizola, balulwengisi bwabu mu misamu bemimi. Kebeeno kweno, lukotandi mu nzimbukusu zi bantu bambi, mwanki lulembolo zimbisa kusikama ku kiminu kyeno. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Bika bumbote na luzaabu lu Mfumu na Muvuukisi eto, Yesu-Klisto, bikula mu yeno. Nkembo ku yandi, bubu natee mu mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>